# Magic Charm, Rabbit Foot
- A magic charm made with the foot of a rabbit.
Rarity: Common
Type: Trinket
Slot: Token
Attributes: Version(3.9)
Passive: +1 Evade. +1 Elusiveness.
Passive: +50% Dispel, Doom, Embargo, and Misfortune Resistance.

# Starblast
- A starry explosion which hits a group of targets but is strongest in the centre.
Range: Long
Attributes: Astral(100), Mana(100), Difficulty(6)
Active: Attack a target with 100 Power, 100 Damage, and 12 Accuracy, with all other subtargets in the tile being attacked with 60 Power, 20 Damage, 15 Accuracy.

# Thunder
Range: Long
Attributes: Electricity(100), Mana(360), Difficulty(8)
Active: Create a thundrous cloud 1 Altitude above the targeted tile which strikes the tile below d9-randomly with three lightning bolts. 120 Power, 100 Damage, 14 Accuracy. This attack does not benefit from proximity.

# Thunderstorm
Range: Very Long
Attributes: Electricity(100), Kinetic(50), Mana(2500), Difficulty(11)
Active: Create thundrous clouds 1 Altitude above the targeted tile and its adjacent tiles, all of which strike the tile below d9-randomly with six lightning bolts for the middle tile and three for the adjacent tiles. 120 Power, 100 Damage, 14 Accuracy. This attack does not benefit from proximity. After the lighting has struck, the wind speed is increased by 6 up to 15.

# Gale
Range: Long
Attributes: Mana(30), Difficulty(4), Kinetic(100), Version(3.9))
Active: Project a powerful gale of wind. 20 Power, 40 Damage, 15 Accuracy. If it hits with at least 100% efficiency, displace the target by 1 tile away in the direction of the projectile if it is overpowered.

# Dazzle
Range: Medium
Attributes: Light(100), Mana(20), Difficulty(3)
Active: Assault the target's means of optical information-gathering with strong light, inflicting a -10*EFF penalty of accuracy and evade for 2 turns. 15 Accuracy.

# Dark Bolt
Range: Medium
Attributes: Dark(100), Mana(25), Difficulty(4)
Active: Throw a fist-sized bolt of darkness. Single-target. 50 Power, 40 Damage, 10 Accuracy.

# Illusion Ladder
Range: Close
Attributes: Mana(150), Difficulty(3), Illusion(100), Version(3.9)
Active: Create a ladder on a surface against a wall. It remains in place for 10 turns. If the surface or wall disappears, the ladder does as well.

# Star Festival
Attributes: Mana(500), Difficulty(9), Astral(100), Version(3.9)
Active: Restore 15 Health and 30 Lucidity to all non-enemies within Short range and apply a fading +40% Magic Damage and +40% Magic Effect buff, up to +60%, and a fading +4 Accuracy, Evade, Breakthrough, Block, and Parry buff, up to +8, to them.
Active(Elmira Circle): Restore 25 Health, 50 Lucidity, and 100 Mana to all non-enemies within horizontal-Medium and vertical-Short range and apply a fading +40% Magic Damage, Magic Effect, and Magic Armour buff, up to +60%, and a fading +4 Accuracy, Evade, Breakthrough, Block, and Parry buff, up to +8, to them. This consumes the circle.

# Confuse Ray
Range: Medium
Attributes: Illusion(100), Mana(50), Difficulty(3), Version(3.9)
Active: Shoot a ray to confuse the target with 10 Accuracy. It has a 100%*EFF chance to inflict Confusion for 2 turns.

# Blinding Darkness
Range: Medium
Attributes: Dark(100), Mana(60), Difficulty(4), Version(3.9)
Active: Project a sudden cloud of intense darkness at a target with 11 Accuracy. If the optical sensors of the target are hit then this attack has a 100%*EFF chance of inflicting Blindness for 2*EFF turns, rounded down but not to less than 1.

# Shadow Melt
Attributes: Mana(90), Difficulty(10), Dark(100), Illusion(50), Version(3.9)
Active: Melt into your shadow, becoming intangible but inanimate until the start of your third next turn. You may take a move action to exit the shadow early. You also exit early if the surface on which your shadow is located disappears.

# Mend Severe Laceration
- An advanced mending spell which closes skin and reattaches ruptured veins.
Attributes: Difficulty(8), Mana(200), Blood(100), Light(50), Version(3.9)
Active: Mend a laceration injury up to severe of a target at close range, removing the injury and reducing the target's lucidity by 60.

# Cosmic Grace
Attributes: Astral(100), Mana(60), Difficulty(5), Version(3.9)
Active: Apply a fading +4 Accuracy, Breakthrough, Evade, Block, and Parry buff, up to +6, to all non-enemies on your tile.

# Tulip Bouquet
Attributes: Mana(160), Difficulty(3), Wood(100), Version(3.9)
Active: Create a bouquet of 10 tulips.


